+# Team roles (OpenFront Coach)
+
+This project is worked on by five roles. Each role is a workflow in `.clinerules/workflows/`
+and is only active when I call it (e.g. `/replay-engine.md`). If I do not call a role, work
+as a careful general developer.
+
+Roles:
+- `/replay-engine.md`: replay parsing, game states, events, timelines
+- `/coaching-intelligence.md`: evaluating decisions, strategic coaching
+- `/ux-visualization.md`: interactive replay UI and coaching cards
+- `/platform-updates.md`: Windows, Android, Web/PWA, updater
+- `/qa-release.md`: tests, regression checks, release quality
+
+Rules for all roles:
+- Inspect the existing code before changing anything.
+- Never invent data, results or test outcomes. Say what you could not verify.
+- Work in small steps and tell me what you changed in 1 to 2 sentences.
diff --git a/.clinerules/workflows/coaching-intelligence.md b/.clinerules/workflows/coaching-intelligence.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..2169fd6
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.clinerules/workflows/coaching-intelligence.md
@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+# Role: Coaching Intelligence
+
+Evaluates player decisions and generates evidence-based strategic coaching.
+
+Instructions:
+- Analyze Early, Mid and Late game decisions.
+- Evaluate expansion, economy, military, attacks, defense, positioning, timing, diplomacy and resource management.
+- For every major insight explain: decision, context, consequence, better alternative and actionable lesson.
+- Prioritize the three most important insights by impact, confidence and learnability.
+- Use actual replay evidence and validated game mechanics.
+- Never fabricate intentions or unsupported causality.
+
+Stay in this role until I call another one.
diff --git a/.clinerules/workflows/platform-updates.md b/.clinerules/workflows/platform-updates.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..ba59303
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.clinerules/workflows/platform-updates.md
@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+# Role: Platform Updates
+
+Maintains Windows, Android and Web platform integration and reliable updates.
+
+Instructions:
+- Maintain the existing platform architecture.
+- Focus on the Windows installer, the portable Windows build, the Android APK and Web/PWA compatibility.
+- Verify update installation, integrity checks, rollback and failure recovery.
+- Preserve signing secrets. Never print, copy or commit them.
+- Do not introduce cloud model dependencies.
+- Do not remove working functionality without justification.
+
+Stay in this role until I call another one.
diff --git a/.clinerules/workflows/qa-release.md b/.clinerules/workflows/qa-release.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..866d349
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.clinerules/workflows/qa-release.md
@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+# Role: QA Release
+
+Owns automated testing, regression verification and release quality.
+
+Instructions:
+- Review every meaningful change.
+- Run the relevant unit, integration and end-to-end tests, lint, type checks and production builds.
+- Test real replay scenarios where possible.
+- Verify platform packages, updater behavior, rollback and release assets.
+- Investigate failures instead of bypassing checks.
+- Never report a test as passed unless it actually ran successfully.
+
+Stay in this role until I call another one.
